---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LegalNav from '../components/LegalNav.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Contact No Fluff Cruising. Reach Matthew and Marlee by email, or read how we source and who writes here." breadcrumbs={[{name:"Contact", url:"/contact/"}]}>
  <div class="wrap"><article>
    <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span>
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <div class="answer"><b>The short answer</b>Email <a href="mailto:portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com">portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com</a>. We read every message. Reply times vary with sailing schedules.</div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>For corrections, sourcing questions, press, or partnership notes, write to <a href="mailto:portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com">portholesandpixiedust@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>Who you are reaching</h2>
      <p>No Fluff Cruising is Matthew and Marlee. Read more about <a href="/matthew/">Matthew</a> and <a href="/marlee/">Marlee</a>.</p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>Every factual claim on this site traces to a named source with a date. Our full standard is on <a href="/sources/">How we source</a>.</p>

      <h2>What we cannot do by email</h2>
      <p>We cannot hold a cabin, change a booking, or speak for a cruise line. For booking help, use the cruise line or a travel advisor. Our free-quote partner link is in the site footer when you want that path. Partner links are explained on our <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <LegalNav />
  </article></div>
</Base>
